<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT - NIDEC raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NIDEC raised.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Institute of Research Ltd upgraded NIDEC Corp to a &quot;A&quot; from its previous &quot;B&quot;, Daiwa Securities brokers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute assigns an &quot;A&quot; rating to issues whose values it sees outperforming the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index by more than 10 percentage points over the next six months.</p>
</text>
